# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile — only what the runtime image needs.
# Weights are NOT baked in: the container pulls the runtime bundle from a
# private HF dataset at cold start (deploy/entrypoint.sh + DEPLOY.md).
*
!requirements.txt
!app
!app/**
app/*.db
app/*.db-*
app/**/__pycache__
app/**/__pycache__/**
!dashboard
!dashboard/dist
!dashboard/dist/**
!deploy
!deploy/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/fetch_bundle.py
